        "identity": "dante",
        "anchor_text_pt": "Quarenta e sete. Cortaram o lacre, mas deixaram as peças. O Raul vai saber de quem é. Não é a carga do Vicente.",
        "anchor_performance": "One adult male character with a consistent individual voice. Grounded mid-low male voice, compact phrases, attentive starts, restrained breath before personal admissions. Dry humor, delayed answers when vulnerable. Act to one scene partner. Clear intelligible speech, meaningful pauses and natural emotional turns. No announcer cadence, forced extreme pitch or caricature. Speak native Brazilian Portuguese with colloquial connected phrasing and Brazilian vowels. Do not invent regional accents from occupation, poverty or surname. Reference performance: Certainty builds through the evidence; a brief disappointment at the final distinction. Make this a lived exchange with a present scene partner: clear operative words, responsive timing and natural breath. Establish identity with an active intention; do not flatten it into an announcer read. Keep the voice healthy and usable for later emotional shifts.",
