        "anchor_text_kind": "existing_directed_dialogue_reference"
      },
      "direction": "Speak natural conversational English. An adult man's voice. Voice identity and usual manner: One adult male character with a consistent individual voice. Grounded mid-low male voice, compact phrases, attentive starts, restrained breath before personal admissions. Dry humor, delayed answers when vulnerable. Act to one scene partner. Clear intelligible speech, meaningful pauses and natural emotional turns. No announcer cadence, forced extreme pitch or caricature. Plain contemporary English, contractions and dry understatement. Speak idiomatic natural English with contractions; preserve Brazilian names and relationships. No racial or national stereotype. Scene performance overrides habitual emotion, pacing and breathing while preserving voice identity: Soft certainty, without romantic overstatement. Perform only the supplied dialogue verbatim. No introduction, music or sound effects. Dry close-mic recording.",
